Run Locally

JavaScript modules do not load from a file:// address, so the page must be served over http.

Open the project folder in VS Code.
Install the Live Server extension.
Right-click public/index.html and choose Open with Live Server.
How to Use
Click Select on any day in the Office Hours table.
The status line shows "Updating…", then "Booking #N confirmed".
Click Select again on the same row to cancel it.
Keyboard: Tab to a button and press Enter or Space.
